[00:22.58]Vocals (Rapid-fire staccato): "हा... हू... हौ... हन्... हनु... हनु... हनु... मान्! ह्-हनु... ह्-हनु... ह्-हनु... ह्-अनुमान!
[00:51.72]बाल हनुमान की गूँजी मेधा, जाम्बवंत का जागा संप्रभु ज्ञान,
[01:06.30]अनुमान (Estimation) के कोडिंग नियमों से, हल होता हर एक लेसन महान!
[01:35.45]अनुमान मतलब Estimation! ... रणनीतिक मतलब Strategic! Chhat!"[STAGE 1: PRIMARY EXPRESS (Classes 1 to 5) | 105 - 120 BPM]
[01:50.03]Sonic Profile: Upbeat playfulness, syncopated claps, bamboo flute, earthy santoor.
[02:04.60]Track 01-13 (Class 1 - Sanaatana Express): Focuses on Spatial shapes, Numbers 1-9 (Pingala binary roots), and "Baal Hanuman Anthem" for baseline integrity values (Eemandari & Dayaluta).
[02:19.17]Track 14-26 (Class 2 - Anandamay Express): Focuses on 2-Digit Place Values, Baudhayana geometry, Kanada mass balancing, and Panini Bilingual Bridge.
[02:33.75]Track 27-39 (Class 3 - Medha Jagriti Express): Focuses on 3-Digit Expanded matrix, Brahmagupta multiplication, Kautilya trade math, and "Hanuman Chalisa (Estimation Logic)" staccato chant ("ha hu hau han hanu hanu hanu maan h-hanu h-hanu h-hanu h-anumaana").
[02:48.33]Track 40-52 (Class 4 - Tarkiq Anveshan Express): Focuses on 4-Digit structures, inverse division loops, Kanada volumetric capacity, and "Gyani Guru Jaambvant Logic Matrix".
[03:02.90]Track 53-65 (Class 5 - Primary Shikhar Express): Focuses on Sulba-Sutra acute/obtuse angles, LCM/HCF factoring, Perimeter layouts, and Charaka-Sushruta sensory biology.
[03:17.48]Track 66-68 (Primary Patches): Completes Subtraction currency loops, Smart charts data handling, and Aryabhata celestial space astronomy.
[03:32.05]Lyrics Matrix Drop: "संख्या के पास की संख्या पकड़ो, राउंडिंग-ऑफ का चक्रव्यूह जकड़ो! माता-पिता मतलब Parents, पूर्वज मतलब Ancestors! Chhat!
[03:46.63]Sonic Profile: Progressive tech-folk transitioning into aggressive drill-phonk, heavy 808 sub-bass stamps, sharp rhyming.
[04:01.20]Track 69-81 (Class 6 - Gyaan-Pravah Express): Zero operations, divisibility systems, Baudhayana vectors, and Agastya electric battery cells.
[04:15.77]Track 82-94 (Class 7 - Maha-Samrajya PCU Core): Features the Cinematic Universe Epics: "Raja" (Raja Bhoj robotics), "Had Se Zyada" (Nirguna integrity), "Mahamatya" (Chanakya economics), and Alchemical metallurgy (Nagarjuna Rasavidya).
[04:30.35]Track 95-107 (Class 8 - Gyaan-Samrajya Express): Rational vectors, polygon angle totals, Bhaskaracharya identities, and Krishi-Parashara agro-tech optimization.
[04:44.93]Track 108-110 (Middle Patches): Practical geometry constructions, medieval geocultural architecture, and bio-energy adaptations.
[04:59.50]Lyrics Matrix Drop: "चाणक्य की पण-मुद्रा दमकी, राजा भोज की धारानगरी चमकी! स्थानक मतलब Spatial, अन्वेषण मतलब Exploration! Chhat!
[05:14.08]Sonic Profile: Hyper-aggressive industrial cyberpunk drill, fast rap cadences, metallic snare rolls, anti-stress fortification.
[05:28.65]Track 111-123 (Class 9 - Medha-Samrajya Express): Irrational vectors, Cartesian coordinate plotting, Baudhayana axioms, and cell architecture matrix.
[05:43.23]Track 124-136 (Class 10 - Board-Samrajya Express): Euclidean division, Sridharacharya quadratic formula, Arithmetic Progression loops, and Aryabhata Trigonometric Sine/Cosine base.
[05:57.80]Track 137-138 (Secondary Patches): Wave mechanics sound geometry, Carbon bond organic networks, and periodic data analytics.
[06:12.38]Lyrics Matrix Drop: "द्विघात सूत्र का ग्रिड लॉक हुआ, बोर्ड परीक्षा का डर खाक हुआ! अनुकरणीय मतलब Exemplary, नियम मतलब Rule! Chhat!
[06:26.95]Sonic Profile: Hyper-dynamic progressive synth-orchestral metal mixed with quantum trans-metal phonk.
[06:41.53]Track 139-151 (Class 11 - Gyaan aur Tarkiqa Samrajya): Set domain-range loops, Meru-Prastar (Pingala binomial expansion base), vector mechanics, and quantum thermodynamics.
[06:56.10]Track 152-164 (Class 12 - Apex-Board Express): Surjective mapping, Cramer matrix solutions, infinite calculus continuity (Sangamagrama Madhava optimization), Gauss electronic fields, and Bayes theorem machine learning logic.
[07:10.67]Track 165-168 (Apex Patches): Linear inequalities, thermal matter kinetics, ray/wave optics, and organic chemical engineering synthesis (NEET/JEE Core).
[07:25.25]Lyrics Matrix Drop: "कैलकुलस की सीमा टूटी, मेरु-प्रस्तार की मेधा छूटी! संप्रभुता मतलब Sovereignty, जिम्मेदारी मतलब Responsibility! Chhat!
[07:39.83]Rhythm track cuts aggressively into sharp, high-impact syncopated percussive 'Chhat' claps, ending in absolute generic, clean silence.
